
This batch-file generates the on-line HTML-documentation for the
callin/callout-interfaces. The javadoc.exe utility shipped with JDK from Sun
must be on the command-path.

The makedoc.bat places the documentation in the ..\Java\doc directory.

IMPORTANT!!!
After generating the documentation you must copy the
jdk1.1.X\docs\api\image directory and its contents to the ..\Java\doc
directory. If you don't, there will be broken links in the HTML-pages.

To start browsing the documentation, open the file packages.html in your
favourite web-browser. Enjoy!
